 PROVED main deliverable: a precise obstruction to the unqualified bulk-versus-PSD dichotomy, uniform over all three permitted vertex-set choices, and a deterministic infinite family disproving CLIQUE-S for every proposed pair of absolute constants. These are obstructions to the stated lemmas; neither refutes the programme after conditioning on a hypothetical K=o(sqrt(n)).
 
